  "body": "<https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/#the-event-handler-processing-algorithm> treats *callback* as an IDL callback function, while it is created in <https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/#getting-the-current-value-of-the-event-handler> using `FunctionCreate`. Importantly, this means that the [\"callback context\"](https://heycam.github.io/webidl/#dfn-callback-context) is not defined. Annoyingly, we can't just grab it off the stack, because there may not be any JS on the stack at this point.\r\n\r\nCC @annevk @bzbarsky @domenic ",
